{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56273","headline":"蜀中送人游庐山 · 晓峦","name":"蜀中送人游庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君游正值芳春月，蜀道千山皆秀发。\n溪边十里五里花，云上三峯五峯雪。\n君上匡山我旧居，松萝抛掷十矫饰要。\n君行试到山前问，山鸟只今相忆抚？\n（影印本《诗渊》第六册第四四四八页。\n）（按：此诗原署「唐僧峦」。\n唐诗人名相近者惟僧鸾与晓晓峦二人。\n此诗风格不类僧鸾之作，僧鸾又未见入蜀之迹，而晓峦恰爲蜀僧，故暂定爲晓峦作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晓峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}